nts</h2></div><p>Homecomings, service projects and opportunities to reconnect with old friends and the school community.</p></div><div class="events"><?php if($events&&mysqli_num_rows($events)>0){while($event=mysqli_fetch_assoc($events)){?><article class="event"><time><?php echo htmlspecialchars(date('D, d M Y · g:i a',strtotime($event['eventdate'])),ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8'); ?></time><h3><?php echo htmlspecialchars($event['title'],ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8'); ?></h3><span><i class="fa fa-map-marker"></i> <?php echo htmlspecialchars($event['venue'],ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8'); ?></span><p><?php echo htmlspecialchars($event['description'],ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8'); ?></p></article><?php }}else{?><p class="empty">No upcoming alumni event has been published yet. Please check back soon.</p><?php }?></div></div></section><section class="section memories"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">AYISEC through the years</span><h2>Moments we <em>still carry.</em></h2></div><p>A growing collection of the faces, friendships, celebrations and memories that make our old-student community special.</p></div><div class="memory-wall"><?php if($memories&&mysqli_num_rows($memories)>0){while($memory=mysqli_fetch_assoc($memories)){?><figure class="memory"><img loading="lazy" src="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($memory['imagepath'],ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8'); ?>" alt="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($memory['caption'],ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8'); ?>"><figcaption><?php echo htmlspecialchars($memory['caption'],ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8'); ?><?php if($memory['memoryyear']){?><span><?php echo (int)$memory['memoryyear']; ?></span><?php }?></figcaption></figure><?php }}else{?><p class="empty">Our memory wall is being prepared. Check back soon for AYISEC moments from across the years.</p><?php }?></div></div></section><section class="join"><div class="shell"><h2>Your story belongs here.</h2><p>Register as an alumnus to receive school news, alumni events and opportunities to give back.</p><a class="button" href="alumni-join.php">Register as an alumnus</a></div></section><?php include('alumni-help-widget.php'); ?></body></html>
